"Infogear is non-System information tech, made by the Informant, who also supplies the SkySea Guard."
"It listens outside private residences, and its maker holds it to lower privacy standards than the System."
"Infogear watches, glasses and phones reach people by name and address, no number needed."
"It kept local calls and texts working, with delays, when the System halted services."
"Its devices hide the Informant's keys of voices, which his skill can activate all at once."
"Recording like this is illegal on Earth but has loopholes on Anesidora; recordings are for sale."
